        },
        " ",
        {
          "m": "s",
          "sid": "pe5fed6213bc9.2",
          "c": [
            "After the 2001 earthquake Dhamadka's water held more iron, which saddens dye colours, and even one percent of iron leaves black spots on myrobalan-dyed ",
            {
              "m": "cite",
              "key": "rm:pe5fed6213bc9.2",
              "g": [
                "g11",
                "g17",
                "g16"
              ],
              "c": [
                "cloth."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " ",
        {
          "m": "s",
          "sid": "pe5fed6213bc9.3",
          "c": [
            "Ajrakhpur was chosen for good quality groundwater, but its water table is going down and excess iron and rising salinity threaten the craft ",
            {
              "m": "cite",
              "key": "rm:pe5fed6213bc9.3",
              "g": [
                "g1",
                "g17",
                "g16"
              ],
